    "body": "Replacement for draft PR #146 only because the connector Ready-for-review mutation is broken. Code is unchanged.\n\nEXACT_HEAD = 4150311422e96e8e2d6f56460f8f3383fc2e91b0\nBASE = a83621eba5a33feae85960bf95489e8bac8ed711\nARCHIVE_BRANCH = zb-archive-v1\n\nDesign: GitHub Actions + Git provide the event runtime and append-only history. Custom code is limited to byte-preserving ingest/verifier glue.\n\nArchive invariants:\n- exact raw GITHUB_EVENT_PATH bytes preserved;\n- SHA-256 content addressing;\n- no rewrite of existing raw/event identities;\n- verifier fails closed on missing/tampered raw;\n- event-driven only, no polling/schedule;\n- archive self-push excluded;\n- parallel pushes resolved through Git fetch/rebase/retry rather than cancellable concurrency.\n\nFresh evidence on exact HEAD:\nHQ_VALIDATE_RUN = 33236111246 / SUCCESS\nHQ_TESTS = 213 / PASS\nARCHIVE_TESTS = 4 / PASS\nSCOPE_GUARD = PASS\nCONTROL_TOWER_INTEGRITY = PASS\nDUNCAN QC on identical exact HEAD = PASS (prior review 5057024715)\n\nExplicit boundary: V1 archives information that reaches GitHub; it does not claim interception of ChatGPT-only UI messages.",
